INTERPRETATION
For n=2j+2 the exact integer vector tested is

  R_(j,t)(x)
   =sum_(s=0)^t binom(n-1,2s)
      {f_(2s)(N_q^(n-2s))_(0,x)
       -f_(2s+1)(N_q^(n-2s-1))_(0,x)}.

Its x=k coordinate is exactly the full-prefix current Q_(j,t).  The scan
therefore supports a coefficientwise strengthening of FBPC, but bounded
nonnegativity is not theorem evidence for arbitrary k,q,j,t.

